.claude/
.env.local
.env
~$*.xlsx
~$*.docx
~$*.doc
~$*.xls
.~lock.*

# Real, unpublished company financial data — the raw Finance source
# workbooks this whole CTC pipeline was originally built from. Database/13_CTC_Report.xlsx
# and scripts/ctc-data-extraction/*.csv have since been resynthesized (see
# CLAUDE.md's CTC Report gotcha / build history) and are safe to commit — this
# raw source folder never is, same reasoning as why Attendance Violations'
# real source report was never committed either.
/CTC/

# Real, unpublished SAP HRIS exports (names, salaries, national ID data) and
# everything derived from them before any resynthesis step -- unlike the CTC
# pipeline above, this data is real and loaded into Supabase AS-IS (that's
# the point of this migration), so there is no resynthesized/anonymized
# version of it to commit instead. The generator scripts (*.ps1) and
# RUNBOOK.md that operate on this data contain no PII and stay tracked.
/HR Reports/
/scripts/sap-migration/*.csv
/scripts/sap-migration/workbooks/
